{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X的音乐细节和情绪层次明显不如Y细腻，缺少随音乐进程逐步展开的具体感受和同步提示。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"X的两栏结构更容易快速扫视，叙事句也把受委屈、怀念亲近、害怕孤单、不愿轻易回头之间的因果和心理转折交代得更顺，尤其结尾把即使暂时没有亲近的人也要继续好好生活说完整了。Y通过重点字放大和分时出现的感受，更容易抓住局部要点，音乐情绪也更细腻具体，但话与感受交替出现，加上较密集的提示，容易让观众在关注局部时丢失故事主线。整体而言，X更适合边听边理解一个完整的人物心理过程，Y更适合细品音乐中的局部情绪变化。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad916833-1d53-4410-bc25-80d51aa8ea7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T080233499071Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:04:04.556357+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "72c2290f0de28d9c7b12b8497353e497500e60e4c24030726c4137cd21374e97", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1